MODULE: FallbackDropsTombstones
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the bootstrap fallback skips tombstone rows, so a delete lost behind a trimmed WAL or below the cursor never heals
PERTURBS: Fallback

--- FIND
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(k, aStore[k].ts, aStore[k].del) : k \in FallbackRows}
--- REPLACE
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(k, aStore[k].ts, FALSE) : k \in {j \in FallbackRows : ~aStore[j].del}}
--- END